  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smart and Electric Public Transport Services for low-carbon city development in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A.     Investment in smart public transport systems including Intelligent Transport System (ITS), Bus Management System (BMS) and Bus Information system (BIS)- includes the development of ITS and transport management center, aiming to enhance public transport services and improve potential passenger&#x2019;s reliability.B.      Investment in e-public mobility and other supporting facilities- includes operation of modes onto low carbon and smart transport modes to reduce economic cost and emissions intensity of urban transport.C.     Capacity-building &#x2013; includes analytics, policy advise, knowledge sharing of related/applicable GGGI project.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to improve public mobility through facilitating the adoption of sustainable public transport services including E-buses and Bus Information and Management System (BIMS) in Kigali City.</narrative>
  </description>
